UID:6jpO6MQYD8
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 118 mins (1h58m)\n\nTwo CIA agents (John Malkovich a
 nd Sam Rockwell) are sent on a mission to Easter Island\, where one faces 
 an existential crisis over his past actions\, in Martin McDonagh’s lates
 t dark comedy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/wild-horse-nine
 \n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
