BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:My Night at Maud's (1969)
DTSTART:20261118T033000Z
DTEND:20261118T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T033000Z
UID:iFjuR2vZHl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nNouvelles FemmesFate and chance 
 entwine as a man (Jean-Louis Trintignant)\, convinced he’ll marry a woma
 n he’s never met (Marie-Christine Barrault)\, is unexpectedly side-track
 ed into an evening with Maud (Françoise Fabienne)\, a desirable paragon o
 f education\, culture\, challenging conversation\, career stability\, and 
 bedroom eyes.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/nouvelles-femmes
 /my-night-at-mauds\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
